@startuml createCourse-analysis-sequence

skinparam linetype polyline

' External actors
actor ":Courses Open" as CoursesOpen
participant ":Collaboration EditCourse" as EditCourse

' Analysis classes - View (Boundary)
boundary "CreateCourseView" as Vista <<boundary>>

' Analysis classes - Control  
control "CourseController" as Controller <<control>>

' Analysis classes - Entity (Entity)
entity "CourseRepository" as Repository <<entity>>
entity "Course" as CourseEntity <<entity>>

title Collaboration Analysis: createCourse()

== Main Flow: Create Academic Course ==

CoursesOpen -> Vista : 1: createCourse()
activate Vista

Vista -> Vista : 2: presents request for\nminimal course data
note right
**System presents request for minimal course data**
• Course name (required)

**System allows requesting:**
• create course
• cancel creation
end note

Vista -> Controller : 3: validateMinimalData(name)
activate Controller

Controller -> Repository : 4: checkUniqueness(name)
activate Repository
Repository --> Controller : 5: isUnique : boolean
deactivate Repository

Controller --> Vista : 6: validationCorrect : boolean
deactivate Controller

Vista -> Controller : 7: createCourse(name)
activate Controller

Controller -> Repository : 8: create(name) : Course
activate Repository

Repository -> CourseEntity : 9: new Course(name)
activate CourseEntity
note right
**Course created with minimal data:**
• Name: [provided]
• Other fields: default values
• Status: active
• ID: automatically generated
end note

CourseEntity --> Repository : 10: newCourse : Course
deactivate CourseEntity

Repository -> Repository : 11: persist(newCourse)
Repository --> Controller : 12: createdCourse : Course
deactivate Repository

Controller --> Vista : 13: createdCourse : Course
deactivate Controller

Vista -> EditCourse : 14: <<include>> editCourse(newCourse)
note right
**Automatic C→U transfer**
• Basic course created
• Automatic complete editing
• "The thin" → "The thick"
end note

deactivate Vista

@enduml